_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NewK</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1455472-\u00e6on-prometheus-unbound#post1455472\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I believe is the next major Trinity product coming out, so what are people hoping for? I know I'm hoping for more psi-tech gadgets and maybe some looks at smaller factions and how they use psoins/psiads.</div> </div> </div> </div>Mission Statements should come out first.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-25T08:03:36-07:00","id":1455574,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1455472-\u00e6on-prometheus-unbound?p=1455475#post1455475\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Mission Statements should come out first.</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019m incredibly excited for both. Every single supplement so far has built on the last to expand the game\u2019s setting. Mission Statements should keep opening up the game universe, while Prometheus Unbound feels like a must have.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12472-foozle","name":"Foozle","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-25T11:45:46-07:00","id":1455581,"title":"","content":"While Mission Statements sounds an awesome book (after Terra Firma, I am excited for basically any possible book coming out for TC, it surprised me so much), but PU is the one I am REALLY expecting now, even more than other big books like Anima and Assassins.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-25T15:51:42-07:00","id":1455588,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NewK</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1455472-\u00e6on-prometheus-unbound#post1455472\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know I'm hoping for more psi-tech gadgets and maybe some looks at smaller factions and how they use psoins/psiads.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, there\u2019s more psi tech gadgets.<br /> <br /> Depends what you mean by factions - this book is about the psi orders. Factions within them, yes. Other groups, no.<br /> <br /> How they use psions, yes. Psiads, no. <br /> <br /> Just managing expectations here - it\u2019s the psi order book. Psions are the focus. There are things that can be adapted to psiads using them - Paths will work if they\u2019re working for psi orders, the tech can be used by anyone (pending access), and the expanded psi rules also apply to them. But there\u2019s nothing exploring psiads in the psi orders.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-25T19:17:52-07:00","id":1455592,"title":"","content":"I hope that at some point Psiads get more specific love than just what they are in the Expansion book. That said till then I will happily yoink any interesting elements about psions and use them in my psiad.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-25T19:47:54-07:00","id":1455593,"title":"","content":"a) Last Tiers of Psi. What happens &quot;post-Proxy&quot;? Psi/Aptiudes 8 and 9 (or even 10?)<br /> b) Full-Powered Psiads. during Aeon, Psiads still aren't &quot;their final form&quot;; they're better than Psiads of Core Era, but hasn't reached humanity final Psi potential. I'd like to see that.<br /> <br /> I'm making a Nexus supplement dealing with &quot;b)&quot; (maaaaybe will delve into &quot;a)&quot;), but official rules would spare me the job and give a canon answer XD","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1001-timecrafter","name":"Timecrafter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1001_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-25T20:35:43-07:00","id":1455594,"title":"","content":"I hope they wait on full power Psiads until some hypothetical TC era after Aeon. Jazzed for both books though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6-slagheap","name":"Slagheap","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-26T10:17:06-07:00","id":1455620,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Timecrafter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1455472-\u00e6on-prometheus-unbound?p=1455593#post1455593\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">a) Last Tiers of Psi. What happens &quot;post-Proxy&quot;? Psi/Aptiudes 8 and 9 (or even 10?)</div> </div> </div> </div>I know it's traditional in Story* systems that everything rounds to a multiple of 5, but in this case Aptitudes are intended to max out at 7. There's nothing currently &quot;missing.&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-11T15:24:00-07:00","id":1456621,"title":"","content":"Will there be rules on how Electromanipulation affects bioapps?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26999-rhiannon-vashti","name":"Rhiannon Vashti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26999_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-11T22:56:19-07:00","id":1456638,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rhiannon Vashti</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1455472-\u00e6on-prometheus-unbound?p=1456621#post1456621\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Will there be rules on how Electromanipulation affects bioapps?</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1332060-electrokinesis-and-biocomps?p=1332501#post1332501\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1332060-electrokinesis-and-biocomps?p=1332501#post1332501\"> Electrokinesis and biocomps - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1332060-electrokinesis-and-biocomps?p=1332501#post1332501\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1332060-electrokinesis-and-biocomps?p=1332501#post1332501 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Why is Orgotek so focused on biotech, when their Aptitude gives them so much more facility with hardtech? The average low-level EK can't do anything to use or affect biotech that any Joe on the street can't do. Is there something I'm missing? An EK can use Tap (Techno 1) to read a hardtech computer, or Access/Control (Techno 2/3) to totally control any hardtech electronic system, from computers to guns to vehicles. However, they require at least Anima (Electromanipulation 4) to have any control over biotech, but that only lasts for a few rounds and doesn't even let them read any data stored on biocomp </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-12T02:19:24-07:00","id":1456641,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1455472-\u00e6on-prometheus-unbound?p=1456638#post1456638\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1332060-electrokinesis-and-biocomps?p=1332501#post1332501\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...01#post1332501</a></div> </div> </div> </div>I have already seen this thread and copy/pasted the requisite information. What I wanted to know was whether this, or something similar, would be in &quot;Prometheus Unbound&quot;. I prefer hardcopy to digital, it has more authority.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26999-rhiannon-vashti","name":"Rhiannon Vashti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26999_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-12T05:14:50-07:00","id":1456644,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rhiannon Vashti</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1455472-\u00e6on-prometheus-unbound?p=1456641#post1456641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have already seen this thread and copy/pasted the requisite information. What I wanted to know was whether this, or something similar, would be in &amp;quot;Prometheus Unbound&amp;quot;. I prefer hardcopy to digital, it has more authority.</div> </div> </div> </div>It will contain a system and guidance for making your own effects, but no, it won\u2019t contain this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","